    <briefdescription>
<para>Extracts structured tables from legal documents. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Recognises pipe-delimited Markdown-style tables and whitespace-aligned column grids (common in German court decisions and contracts). Each detected table block becomes one TABLE-modality <ref refid="structthemis_1_1training_1_1_training_sample" kindref="compound">TrainingSample</ref> whose <computeroutput>input</computeroutput> is the raw table text and <computeroutput>output</computeroutput> is a JSON-like column summary. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
